391", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974471_782428476616724_1116172443318779459_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_XnpR67HirsQ7kNvwGb7yC5&_nc_oc=AdpCrvPrOkErpgq3xz9Q3Q_OvDZb_V8WOkn5EGxr4sn4QfEhrmmmdqDch2-1J9wPbAk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4e_yPgw7AIsOdK_3d--Igd2nM_ZtY58Rm3ZPdxHmJgmA&oe=6A1EE691"}, {"file_name": "scr_4.png", "id": "159298223794289", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031624_159298230460955_160499850208589564_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZI3TJTUFwzQQ7kNvwGNaoeP&_nc_oc=AdrJL4IoUzgNK8dhFFlUnRu5mXpd82TBWUYNUoWnoYVT7o8hQqdmS4eoev0WnMIkVPQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5_T7ybi6L6BKeAHu3DyfAHPmZP_vjB_svoivEAYcatIg&oe=6A1EEE5D"}, {"file_name": "scr_3.png", "id": "1622890074875818", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003228_1622890078209151_210179435196440368_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DjB3UZ3DwPsQ7kNvwEH5vmO&_nc_oc=Adq6-rIyyznEw3HDbwi5DevnOK2jY79Fjkfhq5l0S9DQPd73FaMH9zMXtPsOJThORbU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6o-ocHNPQq4maxz1_mzrGCXQ3x7Tu96rfeZg2-Zu1PKQ&oe=6A1EE139"}, {"file_name": "scr_2.png", "id": "177703811915843", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003228_177703815249176_1528287960455225088_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HxvvCO4CmrIQ7kNvwHEhvlH&_nc_oc=AdoZ75FP2dio4mL2iYqCcT9gAxAD3_mOJo9uWyR4n9v5zZDRzfUGLHhDIaLFap487i8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af54d-TNlpzL8AFoiFg2Tn42hlvmkY_vaunbeiqctyFaJw&oe=6A1ECF8A"}, {"file_name": "scr_5.png", "id": "808935813774196", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031332_808935817107529_8861221418933832083_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wWhGarmG-3AQ7kNvwEVINcO&_nc_oc=AdrvXKwrq3kBjNxKLutbNZ8kuiOwm-wJ4Z3RQEKN5f4F_V7HzHvg0xw_cVR5CuD5OjM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4KWdqucabhof_Y5Py6YablF2ZCm5MkU_QfTTjeDUQfww&oe=6A1ED05C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "The king is gone", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In this game, you have to run away. Different doors are blocking the way, that need to be unlocked to proceed as fast as possible. Each door will give a different benefit, and a combination of them is the key to succeed .. or fail.\n\nTo open a door, a puzzle is presented, where pieces of a key have to be rotated and merged together to open the door. The further you run, the more difficult the key puzzles become.\n\nThere are three different modes:\n\n* Normal Mode: Score is increasing the more you survive. It decreases the more you stay idle in a room without picking a door. There's a set amount of rooms to complete before reaching the end.\n* Endless Mode: Score increases with each room that is completed. There is no end to the amount of rooms presented.\n* Random Mode: Each door has a specific score as a reward when opened. Rooms and their rewards spawn at random.\n\nThe available benefits from the doors are:\n\n* Green doors: Increase running speed.\n* Purple doors: Increase lock-picking skills, which makes opening new doors easier.\n* Blue doors: Gives extra chances before losing.\n* Brown doors provide no direct benefit, apart from helping complete more rooms.", "short_description": "A puzzle game about running, not because one has somewhere to be, but because one has somewhere they don't want to be."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://afloofdev.com/privacy_policy/games/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Afloofdev", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.afloofdev.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "37